{%- comment -%}
----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
SEARCH IDLE STATE
----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Rendered in two places:
  1. In the search takeover overlay when no query is typed (from header-search.liquid)
  2. As a fallback in predictive-search.liquid when a query returns zero products

Shows an optional menu (Kategorier) followed by a curated "Top produkter" grid.
All content is controlled by theme settings so merchants can tune it without
touching code.

Content is wrapped in a .container so it picks up the theme's standard page
gutters — without this wrapper, the idle state would render edge-to-edge
(predictive-search.liquid has its own .container wrapper for the typed state).

Settings used (from config/settings_schema.json "Søgning (takeover)" group):
  - settings.search_idle_menu        Optional link_list shown first
  - settings.search_idle_heading     Heading for the products grid
  - settings.search_idle_subheading  Subheading / caption for the products grid
  - settings.search_idle_collection  Collection handle to feature
  - settings.search_idle_count       How many products to show (1–20)

********************************************
Supported variables
********************************************

Nothing
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- liquid
  assign idle_menu = linklists[settings.search_idle_menu]
  assign idle_collection = collections[settings.search_idle_collection]
  assign idle_count = settings.search_idle_count | default: 10
-%}

<section class="search-idle">
  <div class="container">

    {%- comment -%} ============ OPTIONAL MENU (Kategorier / popular links) ============ {%- endcomment -%}
    {%- if idle_menu.links.size > 0 -%}
      <nav class="search-idle__menu" aria-label="{{ idle_menu.title | default: 'Kategorier' | escape }}">
        <p class="search-idle__menu-heading h5">
          {%- if idle_menu.title != blank -%}
            {{- idle_menu.title -}}
          {%- else -%}
            Kategorier
          {%- endif -%}
        </p>
        <ul class="search-idle__menu-list unstyled-list" role="list">
          {%- for link in idle_menu.links -%}
            <li>
              <a href="{{ link.url }}" class="search-idle__menu-link" data-instant>
                <span>{{ link.title }}</span>
                {%- render 'icon' with 'arrow-right', width: 14 -%}
              </a>
            </li>
          {%- endfor -%}
        </ul>
      </nav>
    {%- endif -%}

    {%- comment -%} ============ TOP PRODUKTER GRID ============ {%- endcomment -%}
    {%- if idle_collection != blank and idle_collection.products.size > 0 -%}
      <div class="search-idle__products-wrap">
        <header class="search-idle__header">
          {%- if settings.search_idle_heading != blank -%}
            <h2 class="h3">{{ settings.search_idle_heading }}</h2>
          {%- endif -%}
          {%- if settings.search_idle_subheading != blank -%}
            <p class="text-subdued">{{ settings.search_idle_subheading }}</p>
          {%- endif -%}
        </header>

        <product-list class="product-list product-list--compact search-idle__grid" style="--product-list-items-per-row: 3;">
          {%- comment -%} Skip Free (configurator add-ons) and upsale (bundle gifts).
            These are reachable through the products they bundle with, not directly. {%- endcomment -%}
          {%- assign hidden_types = 'Free,upsale' | split: ',' -%}
          {%- for product in idle_collection.products limit: idle_count -%}
            {%- unless hidden_types contains product.type -%}
              {%- render 'product-card-menu',
                  product: product,
                  stacked: true,
                  show_quick_buy: false,
                  show_secondary_image: false
              -%}
            {%- endunless -%}
          {%- endfor -%}
        </product-list>
      </div>
    {%- endif -%}

  </div>
</section>
